ytdownloader (0.3.2-1) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * Button row rework: single "Download" button (replaces "Download now" and
    "Add to queue"); "Pause all" renamed "Pause downloads" and "Clear list"
    renamed "Clear downloaded", both moved to the right-hand side. Clear
    downloaded now removes only completed/failed items; per-row ✕ handles
    everything else.
  * Extra spacing above the merged "Downloads" heading.

